{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>A widow and a divorcée.</b> Whether from a priest or from an Israelite." "<b>And a profaned woman who has committed harlotry.</b> Defective [in] the vav of connection, like שמש, ירח, עמד, זבולה." "And the reason for adding <b>only a virgin</b> is to remind His people that a captive virgin who converts to Judaism is forbidden to him."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:34.315227464Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}